# the XanMod LTS series extracted by xanmod_lts.py: derived from their git,
# half a megabyte, regenerated in seconds. xanmod/manifest.txt IS versioned
# -- it is the reviewed verdicts, and the chain refuses to build without it.
xanmod/serie/

# Run-time state of the chain and of its trigger, both written on the build
# machine and meaningless anywhere else: xanmod/etat.txt is the last pair
# (XanMod tag, Ubuntu version) that was looked at, xanmod/annonce.txt is the
# news waiting to be read. Versioning either would make `git add -A` commit
# one machine's moment as if it were the project's state.
xanmod/etat.txt
xanmod/annonce.txt
